  "prefLabel": "Env-A 205.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 205.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to any person who is or would be directly and adversely affected by the strict application of a rule in Env-A 100, et seq., and who wishes to request a waiver from the rule.\n\nSource. #6506-B, eff 5-1-97; ss by #8128, eff 7-28-04; ss by #10187, eff 9-25-12; ss by #13491, eff 11-19-22",
